\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The star of morn has risen:
\par O Lord, to Thee we pray
\par O uncreated Light of Light,
\par Guide Thou our way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sinless be tongue and hand,
\par And innocent the mind;
\par Let simple truth be on our lips,
\par Our hearts be kind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. As the swift day rolls on,
\par Still, Lord, our guardian be;
\par And keep the portals of our hearts
\par From evil free.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Grant that our daily toil
\par May to Thy glory tend;
\par And as our hours begin with Thee,
\par So may they end.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

